Dear Employee,

This email confirms updates to our HR leave and benefits policy effective
February 1, 2024.

1. Annual leave entitlement increases from 18 to 20 days for full-time staff.
2. Parental leave remains at 12 weeks paid leave.
3. Remote work requests must be approved by the employee's manager and HR.
4. Termination requires either party to provide 30 days written notice, except
   in cases of gross misconduct.
5. Performance reviews will be conducted twice per year.

Please contact HR if you have questions about payroll, onboarding, or benefits.

Regards,
People Operations
